  sys3mixedshrnonescdxshcessfcvzhbezcnonesrfnone37OptimumStartProg0, !- Name
  IF DaylightSavings==0 && DayOfWeek>1 && Hour==5 && {a4a00acc-656e-469d-ac3c-e491a0b13eaf}<23.9 && {a4a00acc-656e-469d-ac3c-e491a0b13eaf}>1.7, !- Program Line 1
